{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/k9dvnTajhWohUuQLgNYsTA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:55.563657+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/k9dvnTajhWohUuQLgNYsTA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZotTtcgVCRWAVR2s3IeCTmpfH6ExIHGqBGsZgB2zz9c9p4IIpib96JROaiam8nAzbKZficH4HQp4znlTLRP9665AD9oLEsPHooAQR0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>点击蓝字 关注我们</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZou1ibh1NiczLKFgytw4qibxdUNff7yFiaR7A986QgwQjSVQNsKGyG4zcyegJS1VNkHsh8sEakLW1qoaia72K6JAdXn6cscxp1BytsGA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>“血”脉相连，科研启航。中国医学科学院输血研究所始终立足于国家血液安全的最前沿，致力于探索生命科学的深度与广度。为了给优秀学子搭建高水平的学术互动桥梁，我所计划于2026年7月中旬在锦绣成都举办“全国优秀大学生夏令营活动”。我们诚邀全国高校的优秀青年走进协和输血所，近距离感受顶尖实验室的严谨氛围，与资深导师共话学术蓝图。在充满机遇的盛夏，期待与优秀的你在蓉城相遇，共绘医学的新篇章！</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZouonkS7gHjTlmic5xH48I5ScHE4qGIhiaqTDs78PAMoy2PfpbOseB8IMlCseZMZryfh3r9GC3nibvBgUiactVbKE83O51kCFmGZKqA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>输血研究所简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZosSiafuHXn2uHjnoqmITebMZicCzvWWDic2uBavW1EvFQ6nDLTlFe8ibtt7ukhOaBcHOWRz7LBsIKiby3pFYtQd8t9lCIrPEicN28ffo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZotxDuGefz0XicfAI8IrzcOJExUhlSQY2NKeeWxK53ic7xhIyfOeiaf2nDOt4rYCZw7FJSE3dXScv9EVBusHdiajvwnUnCPhuJeGfI0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span>中国医学科学院北京协和医学院输血研究所（以下简称输血所）位于四川省成都市，为国家级输血医学研究机构，输血所承担着中国医学科学院北京协和医学院输血医学系的教学、科研及相关职责。自1957年建所以来，输血所始终肩负着保障国家血液安全、提升输血医学科研水平的重大使命。凭借深厚的学术积淀与国际前沿的科研平台，研究所在输血传播疾病、干细胞与再生医学、细胞与基因治疗、输血医学工程、血浆蛋白质、临床输血、血液资源管理等领域持续深耕，构建了从基础研究到成果转化的全链条科研体系。</span></p><p><span>目前输血所共有在职博士生导师7人，硕士生导师18人，在培博(硕)士研究生80余人。欢迎优秀的2027年应届本科生申请。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span><span>招生专业</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZos6HbbaYPxEKxkoQ643OKBqH75SMkprBsz4bMXLBo8CKPhBGP0recZJxAo12vYepDGzQQz83wEnUqRjVPWwrw04bheiasxWV7bM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span><span>招生导师简介</span></span></strong></p><p><span>北京协和医学院官网：</span></p><p><span>https://yzbss.pumc.edu.cn/basicinfo/tutorinfo/tutorlist</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZotZfyuic5HtZlicUnK1hOHx3MtjH36kudrfOVP8Yu66QsLcDCbbBj0FibYw3XOzJo8VLyZjH4LbWFM026Cg1SZGickwsv4yic2jtib0Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZovo8Ck9N2OxurNbeMuK9QgYCSRz8ywdyEMkwx3KrlQUfBUJcVkTQGNRDbwia6a4reY4DRKEZdeeqAMbRgdFTqBSKEqh4U3Xa30I/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZouLEc8Ig7OOheycdTCf5vW3zJ7ztJO6yKyqmLdC8K7PB9aDy4Yiaggp1dic3tay5eZBAXbQU5NCdWdeMhK5IhPPetICOWWic5ygHM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZosbPu6VBicmicq0AsLzxdFYVtO0smZ0kTOvbSUcxNhAnDy4tDkzgA3aykcg0YjDjkHjcIP0CIXxAmflcdn0SdNDicEo5CR2ngaTJ4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span>1.有意向申请我所2027年推荐免试研究生或第一志愿报考我所研究生的应届本科生。所学专业为临床医学、生物学、生物医学工程、基础医学、工学等相关专业普通高校全日制毕业生；</span></p><p><span>2.具有良好的品德，身体健康，在校期间无违法违纪行为；</span></p><p><span>3.对我所的相关专业有浓厚兴趣，学风端正，有志于从事科学研究工作，有相关经历者优先；</span></p><p><span>4.学习成绩优秀，在校期间无重修或者补考科目，能够获得推免资格者优先；</span></p><p><span>5.推免直博生的招生条件为达到全国大学英语六级考试（CET-6）430分及以上，推免硕士生的招生条件为达到全国大学英语四级考试（CET-4）450分及以上。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>* 推免生奖励：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>通过推免录取的硕士生，入学当年可获得北京协和医学院新生奖学金8000元；通过推免录取的直博生，入学当年可获得北京协和医学院新生奖学金10000元。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZosL4IMjKYvxUWRbOVJfMjw0ztNCKRDBZLxriaKMkdLWBfZ70uBUZ3iaVZj4xODa7qbpJmia20PdDnPEftibSxM6GlgFT1ic6MSNwPHA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZouHHYHticUP2duffQuhicBcqXz7zpt1oOY5znG4iaowhJ7CJWfZNuicDHoCt19K0MSqicGs59LrIafAmibeHWvyErNyzsJKRZfCiaHria0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZotHZvLxy8B0Dn8dDXnzcPWE9zle6goXm71EBvSzKXARibibTCLMCk1IZhfSWibo06Sd1Ihkv1ED7qt46YK23p4pibtsEZ6XMEvrwH0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZovxXFlnZ4fvKbkrgky4FQBhG2uQKe3zOiarktIYEtWpxDLgIkMZlmaKXZ1qWP99XrDeB000FC4la3EsOf4W297qwO1N9WX4WbGA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.个人简历；</span></p><p><span>2.截至目前大学期间成绩单和专业排名，须由教务部门盖章；</span></p><p><span>3.英语四级及六级考试成绩证明，或其他有效的英语证明复印件（托福、雅思等）；</span></p><p><span>4.其他证明材料（如体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文或其他原创性工作成果复印件、获奖证书复印件等）；</span></p><p><span>5.身份证正反面复印件、学生证复印件（含学校名称、个人信息）；</span></p><p><span>6.网报信息真实承诺书1份（见底部附件模板）;</span></p><p><span>7.夏令营专家推荐信2封，需要2位副教授(含)以上职称的专家分别推荐（格式不限）。</span></p><p><span>注：各申请人务必保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性，若有虚报、谎报等不端行为，一经查实，将取消入营资格。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZouuFSpyLk8vyH4c6pI7cMbWwg6jFNaPp6hugjV1CvCd3AeHYE2d7dp3miccoEzduGHZiaQvCicOf9WwDyaDtXC60xM88wBtuv2Eiac/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>04</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZovkaFfibuNTzLWLEYzfmrOu9v7I30kPyc0IJ1GicvGJ2u0Ns4Kkicuc1a65wvKCuuFOHC4wfAv6FfjQwwz7S1udDPy7O40scI41fw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>材料提交</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZotj4nnYz56x2xDAM5Fib6OjIcOsfp9gNicz0u1yC0jYgRianoTfWl7qQruheBylxlymtW1gCWJJ6Qt30EtLIrKkafhZpviaWmLg3YM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZouHxtjH8gbHJ6LfqgfHQX7jiarlW2TmrfBT1XO4BzYEV0CaVVshBXLMEkG2NO0sAYjjI1KD0Uibww2r8FibY7xIA4RjE6bzdO35mA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 所有申请材料电子版请按照以上顺序合成一个PDF文件，文件命名：姓名+学校。请于2026年6月30日17:00前通过邮件将以上申请材料发送至邮箱: </span><span><span>ibtjypx@ibt.pumc.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span>2. 收到的个人材料统一筛查，夏令营录取名单将以电子邮件或电话等形式直接通知本人。未收到录取通知的同学不再另行通知。</span></p><p><span><span>报名截止时间：</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026年6月30日</span></span></p><p><span>💠 </span><strong><span>夏令营期间，提供食宿！</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tuKUt2VVZou8FcknSFkhbVcSEeT8Kb2ALTuan2fX72DkiaH0MLa95Gp5cDqreToicibNIFeNfJVVSibC4CemGqEwjMAxs5QWl9ia0goc3oKZbzTY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loadin